<template>
  <main class="library-page">
    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><NuxtLink to="/spec-library/cnc-lathes" class="back-link">← CNC Lathe Spec Library</NuxtLink><div class="kicker">UMS MACHINERY SPECIFICATION LIBRARY</div><h1>Haas CNC Lathes & Turning Centers</h1><p>Research Haas CNC lathe and turning-center families, exact model designations and historical specifications from machinery records accumulated over many years by Used Machinery Source.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="#haas-models" class="hero-primary">Browse Haas Specifications</a><NuxtLink to="/equipment" class="hero-secondary">View CNC Lathes for Sale</NuxtLink></div></div></section>
    <section class="wrap section current"><div class="section-heading-row"><div><div class="kicker sale">FOR SALE NOW</div><h2>Haas CNC Lathes Currently Available</h2></div><NuxtLink to="/equipment" class="text-link">View all current equipment →</NuxtLink></div><div v-if="current.length" class="machine-grid"><article v-for="m in current" :key="m.InvID" class="machine-card"><div class="machine-image-wrap"><img v-if="machineCardImages[m.InvID]" :src="`/Images/${machineCardImages[m.InvID]}`" :alt="`${m.Year || ''} ${m.Manufacturer || ''} ${m.Model || ''}`.trim()" loading="lazy" /><div v-else class="machine-image-placeholder">Current UMS Inventory</div></div><div class="machine-card-copy"><h3>{{ m.Year }} {{ m.Manufacturer }} {{ m.Model }}</h3><p class="machine-type">{{ webDescription(m) }}</p><p class="stock-number">Stock #{{ m.InvID }}</p><p v-if="advertisingSpec(m)" class="adv-spec">{{ advertisingSpec(m) }}</p><NuxtLink :to="machineUrl(m)" class="view-machine-button">View Machine</NuxtLink></div></article></div><div v-else class="notice"><strong>No matching Haas CNC lathe is listed in current inventory right now.</strong> The Spec Library below remains available for research. <NuxtLink to="/equipment#tell-us-what-you-need">Tell us what you need →</NuxtLink></div></section>
    <section class="section muted"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">HAAS MODEL FAMILIES</div><h2>Browse Haas Turning Equipment</h2><p class="intro">UMS historical records include SL, ST, TL, HL, DS, CL and other Haas turning platforms. Original model wording is preserved because similar-looking designations can represent different spindle sizes, bed lengths, live-tool packages, Y-axis configurations, sub-spindles or production generations.</p><div class="family-grid"><article class="family-card featured"><h3>ST Series</h3><p>Modern Haas turning centers including standard, big-bore, live-tool, Y-axis, long-bed and sub-spindle configurations recorded in UMS history.</p><div class="model-links"><NuxtLink v-for="m in familyModels('ST')" :key="m.slug" :to="`/spec-library/haas/${m.slug}`" class="text-link">{{ m.model }} specifications →</NuxtLink></div></article><article class="family-card featured"><h3>SL Series</h3><p>Earlier Haas production turning centers with standard, big-bore, long-bed and live-tool variants spanning many years.</p><div class="model-links"><NuxtLink v-for="m in familyModels('SL')" :key="m.slug" :to="`/spec-library/haas/${m.slug}`" class="text-link">{{ m.model }} specifications →</NuxtLink></div></article><article class="family-card featured"><h3>TL Series</h3><p>Haas Toolroom Lathes and related TL turning configurations used for lower-volume work, prototyping and general machining.</p><div class="model-links"><NuxtLink v-for="m in familyModels('TL')" :key="m.slug" :to="`/spec-library/haas/${m.slug}`" class="text-link">{{ m.model }} specifications →</NuxtLink></div></article><article class="family-card featured"><h3>HL / DS / CL</h3><p>Earlier HL turning centers plus dual-spindle DS and compact CL configurations represented in the UMS historical database.</p><div class="model-links"><NuxtLink v-for="m in otherFamilyModels" :key="m.slug" :to="`/spec-library/haas/${m.slug}`" class="text-link">{{ m.model }} specifications →</NuxtLink></div></article></div></div></section>
    <section id="haas-models" class="wrap section"><div class="kicker">HAAS SPECIFICATION LIBRARY</div><h2>Browse Exact Haas CNC Lathe Models</h2><p class="intro">The UMS historical database contains {{ recordCount }} Haas CNC lathe records across {{ all.length }} exact model designations. {{ models.length }} model pages have usable recorded specification summaries. Similar-looking model names are not automatically combined.</p><input v-model="query" class="search" type="search" placeholder="Search Haas model — e.g. SL-30T, ST-30, TL-3B"><div class="additional-grid"><NuxtLink v-for="m in filtered" :key="m.slug" :to="`/spec-library/haas/${m.slug}`" class="additional-link"><strong>{{ m.model }}</strong><span>{{ usableCount(m) }} historical configuration{{ usableCount(m)===1?'':'s' }}</span></NuxtLink></div></section>
    <section class="wrap section history"><div class="history-label">SPECIFICATION LIBRARY — HISTORICAL INFORMATION</div><h2>How to Use the Haas Spec Library</h2><p>These pages are intended for machinery buyers, dealers and manufacturing professionals researching older Haas CNC lathes. Historical records are not current inventory and do not mean a machine is available for sale.</p><p><strong>Specifications can vary by year, spindle size, control generation, bed length, tooling package and optional equipment.</strong> For that reason, UMS keeps materially different Haas model designations separate and displays the exact model with each historical year record.</p></section>
